The workflow's results
----------------------

The template carries each workflow step's result from its run on
2026-10-12 (results/<step id>.parquet): the confident detections, their H3
cells, the burning cells and their middles, the cells by fire, the
detections by fire, the hulls, the hulls on land, measured, each fire's
fire radiative power, and the fires. They are made from both sources
together; both are free of conditions, and the credits above go with them.


